      <li id="src-3">Fox-Davies, A. C. (1909). <em>A Complete Guide to Heraldry</em>. T. C. &amp; E. C. Jack. — heraldic charges; corbie/raven entries; canting arms examples. (Public domain.)</li>
    </ol>
    <p class="id-claim-note"><strong class="claim-lore">[lore]</strong> named primary and secondary sources</p>
  </section>

